# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，检出时由 core.autocrlf 决定工作区形式。
# 避免同一文件在不同工具（编辑器 / 脚本 / CI）下产生纯换行符噪音 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.apk binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
